{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001003","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001003"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001003","label":"奉車子侯（本卷未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"奉車子侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0103","c-shiji-012-wudi:m033-0053"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0103","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p031","quote":"奉車子侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m033-0053","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p033","quote":"奉車子侯"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0103","start":103,"end":107,"surface":"奉車子侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001003","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m033-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"奉車子侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001003","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p031","text":"四月，還至奉高。上念諸儒及方士言封禪人人殊，不經，難施行。天子至梁父，禮祠地主。乙卯，令侍中儒者皮弁薦紳，射牛行事。封泰山下東方，如郊祠泰一之禮。封廣丈二尺，高九尺，其下則有玉牒書，書祕。禮畢，天子獨與侍中奉車子侯上泰山，亦有封。其事皆禁。明日，下陰道。丙辰，禪泰山下阯東北肅然山，如祭后土禮。天子皆親拜見，衣上黃而盡用樂焉。江淮閒一茅三脊為神藉。五色土益雜封。縱遠方奇獸蜚禽及白雉諸物，頗以加祠。兕旄牛犀象之屬弗用。皆至泰山然後去。封禪祠，其夜若有光，晝有白雲起封中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000941","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"地主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000941","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0103","start":103,"end":107,"surface":"奉車子侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001003","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"后土","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m031-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000941","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p033","text":"天子既已封禪泰山，無風雨菑，而方士更言蓬萊諸神山若將可得，於是上欣然庶幾遇之，乃復東至海上望，冀遇蓬萊焉。奉車子侯暴病，一日死。上乃遂去，并海上，北至碣石，巡自遼西，歷北邊至九原。五月，返至甘泉。有司言寶鼎出為元鼎，以今年為元封元年。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m033-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000941","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m033-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"奉車子侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001003","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-012","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi","source":{"title":"史記／卷012","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷012","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷012&oldid=8733061","revision_id":8733061,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"本篇52個p區塊，自孝武皇帝者至太史公論贊；排除導覽dd、索隱述贊、現代版權告示及style／script樣式程式內容。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去除正文區塊內嵌style內容，保留同段史文；保留行內校勘符號及公玊帶等原字。","note":"固定版本與實讀HTML一致；未核底本、影像或本紀傳承研究。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":true}}
